[00:28.56] Gravitated towards a taste
[00:40.86] For foreign films and modern plays
[00:53.69] But that machine could only
[00:58.72] Bend to squares five to six times
[01:06.39] Before your fingers came unwired...
[01:17.98] Weights down so that you could move forwards
